# VoiceOfOpenDoor is published on GitHub. Everything below is private
# working data that must never be committed - see the External Data
# Architecture note in App/backend/app.py and App/backend/local_data.py.

# Local configuration - contains Dean's real folder path
App/local-settings.json

# Legacy in-repo data locations (pre-external-data-architecture).
# Recordings, transcripts, segments, and models now live in the
# user-configured external data folder, not here - but excluded in
# case anything is ever written to these paths again by mistake.
Dataset/Raw Audio/
Dataset/Processed Audio/
Dataset/Transcripts/
Dataset/Segments/
Models/
Exports/
Backups/

# Working media files, wherever they might appear
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.flac
*.aac
*.mov
*.mp4

# Python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# If a narrowly-scoped public test-fixture folder is ever added, allow
# audio inside it specifically - uncomment and adjust the path:
# !Tests/Fixtures/**/*.wav
# !Tests/Fixtures/**/*.mp3
